
simulator lang=spectre
include "/home/install/FOUNDRY/analog/180nm/models/spectre/gpdk.scs" section=NN
include "rfc_ota_core.scs"

Vdd (vdd 0) vsource dc=1.8
Vgnd (gnd 0) vsource dc=0

// Closed-loop DC bias with high-value resistors to find natural DC operating point
Rfb1 (voutp inp) resistor r=1G
Rfb2 (voutm inm) resistor r=1G
Cinp (inp vcm) capacitor c=10p
Cinm (inm vcm) capacitor c=10p
Vcm (vcm 0) vsource dc=0.9

// Biasing voltages
parameters p_vb1=1.23 p_vb2=1.273 p_vb3=0.82 p_vb4=0.801 p_vb5=0.752
Vb1 (vb1 0) vsource dc=p_vb1
Vb2 (vb2 0) vsource dc=p_vb2
Vb3 (vb3 0) vsource dc=p_vb3
Vb4 (vb4 0) vsource dc=p_vb4
Vb5 (vb5 0) vsource dc=p_vb5

CLp (voutp 0) capacitor c=1.0p
CLm (voutm 0) capacitor c=1.0p

XOTA (inp inm voutp voutm vdd gnd vb1 vb2 vb3 vb4 vb5) rfc_ota

op dc
save voutp voutm inp inm XOTA.M9:d XOTA.M1a:d XOTA.M3a:d XOTA.M5a:d XOTA.M7a:d Vdd:p
